    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='ratings'>
      <style />
      <size maxheight='800' maxwidth='1000' minheight='800' minwidth='1000' />
      <zones>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='75250' id='9' type-v2='text' w='34400' x='62500' y='5750'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#aa0000' fontsize='15'>INSIGHTS:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontsize='11'>7 out of 10 bestsellar title is part of a series.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontsize='11'>The top seller is The Mallemaroking Saga part of the  series named the same. which is also the bestseller series.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontsize='11'>It&apos;s of the genre Sci-fi/fantasy.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontsize='11'>Sci-fi is the most checked out genre too.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontsize='11'>Most checked out books are also best sellers.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontsize='11'>Discount and sales are not co-related. high discount does not ensure high sale.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontsize='11'>Books are reasonably priced. Every format is priced in a range without much room for a hike.Most priced ones also have low sales.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontsize='11'>Co relation between Book ratings and  writer&apos;s avg writing time cannot be established.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone h='98875' id='10' layout-strategy-id='distribute-evenly' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='58700' x='1700' y='1500' />
        <zone h='54500' id='11' name='series popularity' w='55800' x='3200' y='3000' />
        <zone h='37625' id='12' name='writing hrs vs. ratings' w='55100' x='3100' y='61000' />
